OL,3,GNEWSAMurs relishing return to Yarmouth
OL,4,Afor new festival
OL,5,
OL,6,FPop star Olly Murs has said he is
OL,7,Frelishing the chance to relive some
OL,8,Fchildhood memories after being
OL,9,Fannounced as the first headliner for a
OL,10,Fnew four-day festival.
OL,12,FThe famous golden sands of Great
OL,13,FYarmouth will host On The Beach, a
OL,14,Fbrand that has brought sell-out shows
OL,15,Fto Brighton each summer.
OL,17,FIts organisers said they were excited
OL,18,Fto "spread our wings" and take the
OL,19,Ffestival to its first sister venue from
OL,20,F17 to 20 June.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
