OL,3,GNEWSAMurs relishing return to Yarmouth
OL,4,Afor new festival
OL,5,
OL,6,FAsa Morrison of Visit Great Yarmouth
OL,7,Fsaid it was a "fantastic opportunity"
OL,8,Fand a real statement of confidence in
OL,9,Fthe Norfolk seafront as a host for
OL,10,Fmajor events.
